        <txtDescrUSNS>!FDC 6/4165 ZAB PART 1 OF 3 AZ..AIRSPACE NOGALES, AZ..TEMPORARY
 FLIGHT
RESTRICTIONS.  
      FEBRUARY 14-AUGUST 14, 2026 LOCAL. PURSUANT TO 49 USC 
40103(B)(3), THE FEDERAL AVIATION ADMINISTRATION (FAA) CLASSIFIES 
THE AIRSPACE DEFINED IN THIS NOTAM AS 'NTL DEFENSE AIRSPACE'. ANY 
PERSON WHO KNOWINGLY OR WILLFULLY VIOLATES THE RULES CONCERNING 
OPS IN THIS AIRSPACE MAY BE SUBJECT TO CERTAIN CRIMINAL PENALTIES 
UNDER 49 USC SECTION 46307.  PILOTS WHO DO NOT ADHERE TO THE 
FOLLOWING PROC MAY BE INTERCEPTED, DETAINED AND INTERVIEWED BY LAW 
ENFORCEMENT/SECURITY PERSONNEL.   
PURSUANT TO 14 CFR 99.7, SPECIAL SECURITY INSTRUCTIONS (SSI), ALL 
UNMANNED ACFT SYSTEM (UAS) FLT OPS ARE PROHIBITED: WI AN AREA 
DEFINED AS 312518N1110730W (OLS260014.2) TO 312418N1110425W 
(OLS255011.6) TO 312415N1104457W (OLS085005.2) TO 313030N1104501W 
(OLS030007.5) TO 313021N1110425W (OLS283012.8) TO 313120N1110727W 
(OLS283015.5) TO POINT OF ORIGIN SFC-400FT AGL  
EFFECTIVE 2602140700 (0000 LOCAL 02/14/26) UNTIL 2608150659  
(2359 LOCAL 08/14/26).  


